abstract: >-
  AI-readable paper skill for Fischer et al. (2026), eTransportation 30, 100636,
  https://doi.org/10.1016/j.etran.2026.100636. It contains the full article text with searchable
  equation transcriptions, Figures 1 to 6, A.7 and B.8 and Tables 1 to 6, C.7 and D.8 (CSV), for use
  with Claude, Claude Code or Codex. Converted with Paper2Agent (Miao et al., Nature 2026,
  https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-026-11044-y). The package contains no raw data and no code.
